---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../lib/site";
---
<Page title="Privacy Policy" description="What data StateMaps collects when you visit (very little), which cookie-free analytics we use, and how to contact us about your privacy." path="/privacy/" updated="November 8, 2026">
  <p>We collect as little as we can.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Vercel Web Analytics to count page views. It doesn't use cookies and doesn't build a profile of you across sites. It records anonymized information such as the page visited, referrer, country and device type.</p>
  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>Our host may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and user agent) for security and debugging, for a limited time.</p>
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we use your message only to reply and keep it only as long as needed.</p>
  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>We link to app stores and developer websites. Their privacy policies apply once you leave our site.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</Page>
